NAME
    gcloud beta service-health organization-events - represents events that may
        affect products used across the organization

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta service-health organization-events COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Represents events that may affect products used across the
    organization.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Get details of an event affecting an organization.

     list
        (BETA) List events under a given organization and location.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud service-health organization-events

        $ gcloud alpha service-health organization-events

